{
  "info": {
    "name": "SondageAPI",
    "description": "Collection de demonstration pour l'API de sondage (Coup de Sonde). Deux sondages sont disponibles : sondage1 et sondage2. Ajustez baseUrl et apiKey dans l'environnement 'SondageAPI - Local' selon le port HTTPS affiche au demarrage (voir Properties/launchSettings.json). Les cles de participation retournees par CreerParticipation doivent etre copiees manuellement dans les variables d'environnement correspondantes (cleSondage1, cleIncomplet) avant d'appeler les requetes qui en dependent. Chaque cle est a usage unique et n'est valide que pour le sondage pour lequel elle a ete emise (impossible structurellement de la faire servir a un autre sondage). Organisee en deux dossiers, un par controleur.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Sondages",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "ObtenirSondages",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sondages",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "sondages" ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "ObtenirSondage",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sondages/sondage1",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "sondages", "sondage1" ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "ObtenirSondage_Sondage2",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sondages/sondage2",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "sondages", "sondage2" ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "ObtenirSondage_Introuvable",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/sondages/sondage-inexistant",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "sondages", "sondage-inexistant" ]
            },
            "description": "Attendu : 404 avec ErreurDto."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Participations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "CreerParticipation",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/sondage1",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "sondage1" ]
            },
            "description": "Attendu : 201 avec CreationSondageDto (cle, sondageId, dateEmission). Copier la valeur de 'cle' dans la variable d'environnement cleSondage1 avant les requetes suivantes."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "CreerParticipation_Introuvable",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/sondage-inexistant",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "sondage-inexistant" ]
            },
            "description": "Attendu : 404 avec ErreurDto (sondage inexistant)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "CreerParticipation_PourReponseIncomplete",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/sondage1",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "sondage1" ]
            },
            "description": "Emet une deuxieme cle, dediee au scenario reponse-manquante/correction ci-dessous. Copier 'cle' dans la variable d'environnement cleIncomplet."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "ObtenirStatutParticipation",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/{{cleSondage1}}",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "{{cleSondage1}}" ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "ObtenirStatutParticipation_CleInexistante",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/cle-qui-nexiste-pas",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "cle-qui-nexiste-pas" ]
            },
            "description": "Attendu : 200 avec StatutParticipationDto (existe=false, sondageId=null)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SoumettreParticipation",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cle\": \"{{cleSondage1}}\",\n  \"reponses\": [\n    { \"questionId\": \"q1\", \"valeur\": \"b\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q2\", \"valeur\": \"a\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q3\", \"valeur\": \"d\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q4\", \"valeur\": \"c\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/{{cleSondage1}}/soumission",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "{{cleSondage1}}", "soumission" ]
            },
            "description": "Attendu : 200 avec ConfirmationSoumissionDto. Le champ 'cle' du corps doit correspondre a la cle de l'URL (voir SoumettreParticipation_CleUrlEtCorpsDifferentes)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SoumettreParticipation_CleUrlEtCorpsDifferentes",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cle\": \"une-cle-differente-de-lurl\",\n  \"reponses\": [\n    { \"questionId\": \"q1\", \"valeur\": \"b\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q2\", \"valeur\": \"a\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q3\", \"valeur\": \"d\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q4\", \"valeur\": \"c\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/{{cleSondage1}}/soumission",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "{{cleSondage1}}", "soumission" ]
            },
            "description": "Le champ 'cle' du corps ne correspond pas a la cle de l'URL. Attendu : 400 avec ErreurDto, sans que le service ne soit sollicite (la cle de l'URL n'est ni consommee ni meme recherchee)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SoumettreParticipation_DejaSoumise",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cle\": \"{{cleSondage1}}\",\n  \"reponses\": [\n    { \"questionId\": \"q1\", \"valeur\": \"b\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q2\", \"valeur\": \"a\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q3\", \"valeur\": \"d\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q4\", \"valeur\": \"c\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/{{cleSondage1}}/soumission",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "{{cleSondage1}}", "soumission" ]
            },
            "description": "A rejouer juste apres SoumettreParticipation, avec la meme cle. Attendu : 409 avec ErreurDto."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SoumettreParticipation_CleInvalide",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cle\": \"cle-qui-nexiste-pas\",\n  \"reponses\": [\n    { \"questionId\": \"q1\", \"valeur\": \"b\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q2\", \"valeur\": \"a\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q3\", \"valeur\": \"d\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q4\", \"valeur\": \"c\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/cle-qui-nexiste-pas/soumission",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "cle-qui-nexiste-pas", "soumission" ]
            },
            "description": "cle du corps identique a celle de l'URL (la validation URL/corps passe), mais cette cle n'existe pas cote serveur. Attendu : 401 avec ErreurDto (cle de participation invalide)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SoumettreParticipation_SansApiKey",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cle\": \"{{cleSondage1}}\",\n  \"reponses\": [\n    { \"questionId\": \"q1\", \"valeur\": \"b\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/{{cleSondage1}}/soumission",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "{{cleSondage1}}", "soumission" ]
            },
            "description": "Sans en-tete X-API-KEY. Attendu : 401, rejete par ServiceAuthentification avant meme d'atteindre le controleur."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SoumettreParticipation_ReponseManquante",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cle\": \"{{cleIncomplet}}\",\n  \"reponses\": [\n    { \"questionId\": \"q1\", \"valeur\": \"b\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q2\", \"valeur\": \"a\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q3\", \"valeur\": \"d\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/{{cleIncomplet}}/soumission",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "{{cleIncomplet}}", "soumission" ]
            },
            "description": "q4 manquante. Attendu : 400 avec ErreurDto ; la cle n'est PAS consommee (voir SoumettreParticipation_ApresCorrection)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SoumettreParticipation_ApresCorrection",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cle\": \"{{cleIncomplet}}\",\n  \"reponses\": [\n    { \"questionId\": \"q1\", \"valeur\": \"b\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q2\", \"valeur\": \"a\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q3\", \"valeur\": \"d\" },\n    { \"questionId\": \"q4\", \"valeur\": \"c\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/participations/{{cleIncomplet}}/soumission",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "participations", "{{cleIncomplet}}", "soumission" ]
            },
            "description": "Meme cle que la requete precedente, reponses completes cette fois. Attendu : 200, preuve que la cle n'avait pas ete brulee par la soumission invalide."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
